items.description:
a. authorize design of facilities in the service area;
b. approve plans and specifications and authorize advertisement for bids for construction of facilities in the service area, including:
i. right turn deceleration lanes to serve Uvalde West tract; and
ii. right turn deceleration lanes to serve New Forest Town Center tract.
c. review bids and award contracts for construction of facilities in the service area, including:
i. water plant no. 1 drainage improvements;
ii. water, sewer, drainage and paving facilities to serve New Forest Town Center tract; and
iii. water, sewer and drainage facilities to serve Uvalde West;
d. approve pay estimates, time extensions, change orders, certificates of completion and final acceptance for projects in the service area, including:
i. generators for wastewater treatment plant no. 1 and lift station nos. 1, 3, 4, and 5;
e. review and approve report on electricity consumption and energy efficiency measures and take any necessary action;
f. deeds, easements, plats, surveys, as-built certifications, appraisals, phase I environmental assessments, consents to encroachment, and utility commitment requests; and
g. proposals for engineering services.

a. operation, maintenance, and repair of District water, sanitary sewer, and storm drainage facilities;
b. sanitary sewer manhole survey;
c. customer billing and collection;
d. smart meter installation program;
e. amendment of District Rate Order; and
f. hearing on termination of water and sewer service to delinquent customers and authorize termination of service.
